# Rule: No Linter Suppressions

A. Linter Suppressions
    - Never disable linter checks except when:
        - Type system limitations require it
        - Third-party APIs force compromises
        - Mathematical properties demand it
    - Suppression requirements:
        - Must be explicitly approved by the user
        - Must be documented with rationale
        - Must be scoped to specific lines
        - Must reference this rule